==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is an [[Aku Altar (Enemy Base)|Aku Altar]].
*3 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory Dark]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Fallen Bear]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Aku Doge]]s spawn, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
**4 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
**3 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The significant prescence of Dark enemies in this stage makes [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] an excellent choice, and the relatively weak Doge Darks mean that [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] with their Money Up [[Talents|Talent]] can be used to make huge money. As for the Fallen Bear, simply chip his Shield down with units like [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic King Dragon]], then deal a little more damage and send in [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] at the right time for a quick kill.

